==English==
{{number box|en|80}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|eiȝti}}, {{m|enm|eyȝty}}, {{m|enm|eiȝtety}}, {{m|enm|aghty}}, from {{inh|en|ang|hundeahtatiġ}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*ahtōutēhundą|t=eighty}}, equivalent to {{af|en|eight|-ty}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|hechty}}, {{m|sco|auchty|t=eighty}}, {{cog|stq|tachentich|t=eighty}}, {{cog|fy|tachtich|t=eighty}}, {{cog|nl|tachtig|t=eighty}}, {{cog|nds|tachentig|t=eighty}}, {{cog|de|achtzig|t=eighty}}, {{cog|sv|åttio|t=eighty}}, {{cog|no|åtti|t=eighty}}, {{cog|is|áttatíu|t=eighty}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|āʹti}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈeɪ.ti/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|[ˈ(ʔ)eɪ̯ɾi]}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-eighty.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|en|eɪti|s=2}}

===Numeral===
{{head|en|numeral}}

# The cardinal number occurring after seventy-nine and before eighty-one, represented in Roman numerals as [[LXXX]] and in Arabic numerals as [[80]].

